This module imports the library and never imports `KasteleynChallenge`.

* `Kasteleyn.orientation_exists : Kasteleyn.OrientationExists`
* `Kasteleyn.pfaffian_formula : Kasteleyn.PfaffianFormula`
* `Kasteleyn.matching_count : Kasteleyn.MatchingCount`
* `Kasteleyn.linear_time_orientation : Kasteleyn.LinearTimeOrientation`
* `Kasteleyn.edgeless_case : Kasteleyn.EdgelessCase`
-/
